Subject: [PATCH] [cmap/format4] Try to ignore wrong subtable length (#5740)

* WIP [cmap/format4] Try to ignore wrong subtable length

Fixes https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/issues/5739

See comments.

* [cmap/format4] Followup fix for unreliable subtable length field

* [cmap/format4] Try to fix previous commit

